+# Cloudflare Deployment
+
+> **Draft / Non-authoritative.** `SPEC.md` remains authoritative until the controlled documentation cutover. This document owns Cloudflare environments, configuration delivery, CI/CD, migrations during deployment, smoke checks, and rollback. It performs no actual provider, analytics, database, or infrastructure integration.
+
+## Platform boundary
+
+<!-- requirement
+id: DEP-FREE-001
+status: Active
+kind: Hard
